{
  "id": "note-from-the-author",
  "kind": "introduction",
  "sourceKind": "author-note",
  "label": "Author's Note",
  "title": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "shortTitle": "NOTE FROM THE AUTHOR",
  "sourceRange": [
    70,
    142
  ],
  "headerSourceParagraphs": {
    "title": 70
  },
  "elements": [
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Lalit R.Mishra",
          "bold": true
        },
        {
          "text": "\t",
          "bold": true
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 71,
      "role": "section-heading"
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There is a strange assumption most minds carry without ever questioning it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 72
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That reality is incomplete."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 73
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That something is missing."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 74
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That somewhere, somehow, life is not yet enough."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 75
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This assumption does not always feel like a belief."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 76
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It feels like common sense."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 77
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Like background truth."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 78
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Like something obvious."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 79
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And because it feels obvious…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 80
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "it is rarely seen."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 81
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Most of what humans call “growth”, “progress”, or “search” is built on top of this single invisible premise:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 82
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that the present is insufficient."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 83
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "From there, everything follows."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 84
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Goals."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 85
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Comparison."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 86
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Becoming."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 87
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Endless adjustment of self."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 88
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Endless adjustment of life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 89
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not necessarily because reality demands it…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 90
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but because the mind refuses to accept what is already here."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 91
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This work does not try to correct life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 92
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It does not try to improve reality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 93
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It does not try to offer a better system of thinking."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 94
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It only tries to expose one subtle distortion:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 95
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "the belief that something is missing right now."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 96
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Because if that belief is seen clearly…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 97
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "something unexpected happens."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 98
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not resolution."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 99
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not completion."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 100
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not final peace."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 101
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But the collapse of the need to constantly resolve."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 102
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And that collapse can feel uncomfortable."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 103
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not because something is wrong…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 104
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "but because the structure of constant searching begins to lose its necessity."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 105
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "A mind built on pursuit does not immediately recognize stillness as safety."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 106
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It often interprets it as emptiness."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 107
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Or loss."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 108
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Or uncertainty."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 109
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But in that moment of resistance…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 110
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "a deeper observation becomes possible."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 111
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "That even this resistance is happening within life."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 112
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not outside it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 113
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not separate from it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 114
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not delayed until later."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 115
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Now."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 116
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "This is the part most interpretations avoid:"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 117
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that there was never a moment when life was “not happening”."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 118
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Only moments when it was not recognized as enough."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 119
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And recognition is not something added to reality."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 120
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It is something that removes the distance created by thought."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 121
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So the danger in this work is not in what it claims."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 122
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "There are no claims."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 123
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The danger is in what it quietly removes."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 124
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The need for an imagined missing piece."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 125
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The need for a future arrival."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 126
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "The need for a final version of experience."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 127
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And when those structures weaken…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 128
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "life does not become extraordinary."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 129
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "It becomes unexplainably ordinary."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 130
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "So ordinary…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 131
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "that the mind struggles to continue its usual story."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 132
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And in that struggle…"
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 133
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "there is a pause."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 134
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not as achievement."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 135
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not as enlightenment."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 136
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Not as escape."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 137
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "But as a direct encounter with what was always already here."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 138
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Unedited."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 139
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Uninterpreted."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 140
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "Unfinished only in thought."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 141
    },
    {
      "type": "paragraph",
      "runs": [
        {
          "text": "And complete without it."
        }
      ],
      "sourceParagraph": 142
    }
  ],
  "suppressHeaderNumber": true,
  "index": 5,
  "file": "chapters/05-note-from-the-author.json"
}
